<%- include('partials/header') %>
<section class="hero"><div class="container hero-grid"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow"><i></i> Bohol, at your own pace</span><h1>Good roads.<br>Great <em>memories.</em></h1><p>A quick island escape or a weekend with the family. Find a car or motorcycle that fits your plans.</p><div class="hero-actions"><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/vehicles">Find your ride <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><a class="hero-text-link" href="#how">How it works <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a></div><div class="hero-trust"><span>✓ Flexible rental dates</span><span>✓ Local pickup</span><span>✓ Simple reservations</span></div></div><div class="hero-photo"><img src="/images/fleet/toyota-vios-1.jpg" alt="Toyota Vios model reference"><div class="hero-photo-shade"></div><span class="photo-location">BOHOL, PHILIPPINES · MODEL REFERENCE PHOTO</span><div class="hero-photo-caption"><span>Your itinerary. Your ride.</span><strong>Make room for<br>a little adventure.</strong></div><a class="hero-photo-arrow" href="/vehicles" aria-label="Explore vehicles">↗</a></div></div></section>
<section class="quick-categories"><div class="container category-strip"><a href="/vehicles?type=Car"><span class="category-icon">↗</span><div><strong>Cars for every getaway</strong><small>Solo trips, family days & group travel</small></div><span class="category-arrow">→</span></a><a href="/vehicles?type=Motorcycle"><span class="category-icon">↝</span><div><strong>Two wheels. More freedom.</strong><small>Scooters & motorcycles for island exploring</small></div><span class="category-arrow">→</span></a></div></section>
<section class="section soft"><div class="container"><div class="section-head row-between"><div><span class="eyebrow">The fleet</span><h2>A ride for your kind of trip.</h2><p class="muted">Choose your dates. We'll take care of the availability check.</p></div><a class="btn btn-light" href="/vehicles">Explore all vehicles ↗</a></div><div class="vehicle-grid"><% featured.forEach(v=>{ %><article class="vehicle-card"><a class="vehicle-image-link" href="/vehicles/<%= v.id %>"><img src="<%= v.image %>" alt="<%= v.brand %> <%= v.model %> model reference" loading="lazy"><span class="image-type"><%= v.type %></span></a><div class="card-body"><div class="row-between"><small class="muted"><%= v.transmission %> · <%= v.seats||2 %> seats</small><span class="status"><%= v.status %></span></div><h3><a href="/vehicles/<%= v.id %>"><%= v.brand %> <%= v.model %></a></h3><p><%= v.fuel_type %> · Model reference photos</p><div class="card-price-row"><div><strong>₱<%= Number(v.daily_rate).toLocaleString() %></strong><small> / day</small></div><a class="round-link" href="/vehicles/<%= v.id %>" aria-label="View <%= v.brand %> <%= v.model %>">↗</a></div></div></article><% }) %></div></div></section>
<section class="section" id="how"><div class="container"><div class="section-head"><span class="eyebrow">Less planning. More exploring.</span><h2>Your next trip, in four steps.</h2></div><div class="steps"><div><b>01</b><h3>Find your ride</h3><p>Browse cars and motorcycles for your trip.</p></div><div><b>02</b><h3>Make it a date</h3><p>Choose your pickup and return schedule.</p></div><div><b>03</b><h3>Reserve online</h3><p>Availability is checked before your booking is confirmed.</p></div><div><b>04</b><h3>Pick up & go</h3><p>Pay online or at the shop, then start exploring.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="section trip-cta"><div class="container row-between"><div><span class="eyebrow">A change of scenery is calling</span><h2>Where will your next ride take you?</h2></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="/vehicles">Let's find out ↗</a></div></section><%- include('partials/footer') %>